# Test-only Control Plane route for the agents registry.
#
# Scoped deliberately: only the module under test gets a route here. The other
# pages' clients still resolve their own defaults, so adding a route for them
# would change their behaviour for reasons unrelated to this test.
#
# The unconfigured case is covered directly in
# src/features/agents/api/__tests__/agentsClient.test.ts, where the route is
# injected as "".
VITE_AGENTS_PATH=/api/agents
